## Belief Network (belief.json)

Default recommendation (`type: "mlp"`): **match the PV network architecture** (same width, depth, residual, block_size). When each logit belongs to one entity (a card), prefer `type: "per_entity"` (one shared scorer per entity). When opponents hold sets of cards from one pool, prefer `type: "autoregressive"` (whole deals, card by card; 6 nimmt! uses a 4x256 trunk and a 2x256 head, Ark Nova a 4x512 trunk and a 2x256 head; the head runs for every sampled prefix, so keep it small).

| Field | Recommendation |
|-------|---------------|
| architecture | Same hidden_layers as PV network (e.g. 12x256 if PV is 12x256) |
| residual / block_size | Same as PV network |
| training.loss | "ce" for categorical outputs (Coup), "bce" for per-face marginals (Liar's Dice) |

Belief logit temperature is framework-fixed at `1.0` and must not appear in `belief.json`; loaders reject it. Belief net trains alongside PV net — one SGD step per selfplay step, using belief samples emitted by the same episodes. No separate training run needed.
